# "At the beginning of EACH end step": Bot1 casts Resplendent Angel on turn 1, puts Black Lotus onto the battlefield on turn 3, then in Bot2's main phase on turn 4 casts Restoration
# Magic's Curaga (gain 6 life), keeping a Mox Ruby untapped with Lightning Bolt in hand so that it is asked at each of Bot2's steps.
# At Bot2's end step Bot1 has gained 5 or more this turn (CR 603.4), so the Angel makes a 4/4 white Angel token with flying and
# vigilance for Bot1, though it is not Bot1's end step. Bot1: 20 + 6 = 26.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Pearl
Mox Pearl
Mox Ruby
Resplendent Angel
Black Lotus
Restoration Magic
Lightning Bolt
Plains x14

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x16

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Pearl.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Pearl#2.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Resplendent Angel.Cast
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
[T4 Bot2.Main1]
Bot1.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: White)
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Pearl.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Pearl#2.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Restoration Magic.Cast
Bot1.Modes(Curaga)
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
? Turn = 4
? Bot1.Life = 26
? Bot1.Battlefield.Count = 4
[T4 Bot2.End]

[Expect]
Stack.Count = 0
Bot1.Life = 26
Bot1.Battlefield.Count = 5
Bot1.Battlefield.Angel Token.Power = 4
Bot1.Battlefield.Angel Token.Toughness = 4
Bot1.Battlefield.Angel Token.Colors = White
Bot1.Battlefield.Angel Token.Keywords = Flying; Vigilance
Bot1.Battlefield.Angel Token.Token = true
